## Additional Notes on AI-Generated Content

This software orchestrates third-party AI services to generate visual and
audio content. Users are solely responsible for:

1. **Fact-checking** all AI-generated content before classroom or public use
2. **Copyright and likeness rights** - especially when generating images of
   real people or recognizable characters
3. **Age-appropriate content** when producing materials for minors
4. **Compliance with each upstream service's Terms of Service**
   (Anthropic, Higgsfield, ElevenLabs, etc.)

The authors and contributors of this project shall not be held responsible
for any misuse, harmful, inaccurate, or inappropriate content generated
through the use of this pipeline.
